{"series":{"id":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro","slug":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro","title":"Una Bruja Sin Cerebro","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-04/1000246051-picaai.png?itok=TyTnnRo-","synopsis":"Para olvidar el pasado, la bruja, que estaba maldita con la vida eterna, arrojó la mitad de su cabeza al profundo valle y escapó. Inesperadamente, las lágrimas que se desbordaron en el fondo del valle formaron un lago, provocando una inundación en el infierno. Alois, el príncipe de la tribu de los demonio, vino al mundo a investigar y finalmente encontró a la bruja. Se desarrolló una historia de vida y amor","status":"En Emisión","year":2023,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/una-bruja-sin-cerebro"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T16:49:03.153Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro-t1","slug":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro-t1","seriesId":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-04/1000246051-picaai.png?itok=TyTnnRo-","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T16:49:03.153Z","episodeCount":15},{"id":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro-t2","slug":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro-t2","seriesId":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro","number":2,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-04/1000246051-picaai.png?itok=TyTnnRo-","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T16:49:03.153Z","episodeCount":15}],"episodes":[{"id":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro-t1-e15","slug":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro-t1-e15","title":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro-1-episodio-x15","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/una-bruja-sin-cerebro-1-episodio-x15","servers":[{"name":"dailymotion.com","url":"https://www.dailymotion.com/embed/video/k1MSyttEJiLRujzwRkx?autoplay=1","embed":true},{"name":"ok.ru","url":"https://ok.ru/videoembed/6612934658593","embed":true}],"seriesId":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro","seasonId":"una-bruja-sin-cerebro-t1","number":15,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T17:09:46.026Z"},{"id